learnings/core.md` and `display.md`, the list `learnings-files --for-diff` printed; `tooling.md` was not listed. Rules that fired: 'When code is added, moved or retired, ask which guards were scoped to the old shape' and 'When you delete a constant or add a required parameter, grep `tools/`' (the tv_api_check finding); 'When you fix a defect, make inputs the fix does not know fail by name' (the throttle overflow). No learnings file changed in this diff, so there is no new-rule pass. No implicit supersession noticed between the rules that bear on this change.", "files": [".claude/rules/learnings/core.md", ".claude/rules/learnings/display.md"], "fid": "R-17"}, {"goal": "Decisions Were Deliberate", "severity": "note", "title": "Backlog Reconciliation", "recommendation": "Scope: none. Cache for brookstalley/arrt-player, confirmed 1h old. `affecting` over the changed src, tools and deploy paths matched 0 items. 24 items are open, and none appears resolved by this change. #27 (serverless slideshow) is the wave-2 item the plan names; it stays open by design. C-B3: #11 ('logs: 55 of 114 event names appear in no test') is in an area this change touches. The change adds eight events, and six appear in no test: `settings_page.listening`, `.password_set`, `.password_changed`, `.login_refused`, `.password_refused` and `daemon.setup_mode`. `deploy/README.md` \u00a7 The settings page tells the operator to check `settings_page.listening` to confirm the deploy worked, so the event a runbook relies on is one no test pins. Assess #11 and update its status. C-B1, C-B2 and C-B4: nothing to flag.", "files": ["deploy/README.md", "src/arrt_player/__main__.py", "src/arrt_player/settings_ui/server.py"], "fid": "R-18"}, {"goal": "Decisions Were Deliberate", "severity": "note", "title": "Records Pass", "recommendation": "Scope: none. Rated all six of `files_oracle` against the three bars: architecture.md, build-plan-settings-ui.md, nonfunctional-requirements.md, security-model.md, changes/sett